  "name": "Win-back Email Writer",
  "description": "Write a win-back email to a customer or segment that has gone quiet, plus five subject lines and a three-touch follow-up plan that knows when to stop. The email acknowledges the gap without apologising, states the offer and its condition plainly, asks a question answerable in one line, and always gives an easy way out. No guilt, no false scarcity, and no invented purchase history \u2014 anything it has not been told is left as a marked gap.",
